        ]
      },
      "segments": [
        {
          "id": "segment-proto05-copy-1784236861048-984dec-1",
          "startMs": 2000,
          "endMs": 23000,
          "text": "On va faire un essai, donc chacun va pouvoir se présenter dans sa langue, donc son nom, son université, les langues connues, les études, activités préférées, projets...",
          "speakerIds": [
            "speaker-proto05-copy-1784236861048-984dec-1"
          ],
          "languageIds": [
            "fr"
          ],
          "phenomenonIds": [
            "phenomenon-proto05-copy-1784236861048-984dec-1",
            "phenomenon-proto05-copy-1784236861048-984dec-2"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "segment-proto05-copy-1784236861048-984dec-2",
          "startMs": 32000,
          "endMs": 58000,
          "text": "Bonjour, moi c’est Marie... J’étudie à l’Université Grenoble-Alpes en master en didactique des langues, en particulier le français langue étrangère.",
          "speakerIds": [
            "speaker-proto05-copy-1784236861048-984dec-2"
          ],
          "languageIds": [
            "fr"
          ],
          "phenomenonIds": [
            "phenomenon-proto05-copy-1784236861048-984dec-3",
            "phenomenon-proto05-copy-1784236861048-984dec-4"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "segment-proto05-copy-1784236861048-984dec-3",
          "startMs": 58000,
          "endMs": 84000,
          "text": "Je parle le français, l’anglais, l’italien couramment. J’apprends l’espagnol cette année... j’ai habité un an en République tchèque...",
          "speakerIds": [
            "speaker-proto05-copy-1784236861048-984dec-2"
          ],
          "languageIds": [
            "fr",
            "es",
            "it"
          ],
          "phenomenonIds": [
            "phenomenon-proto05-copy-1784236861048-984dec-5",
            "phenomenon-proto05-copy-1784236861048-984dec-6"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "segment-proto05-copy-1784236861048-984dec-4",
          "startMs": 91000,
          "endMs": 102000,
          "text": "Vous avez bien compris ? Oui, je crois que tout le monde comprend bien le français, donc pas de problème.",
          "speakerIds": [
            "speaker-proto05-copy-1784236861048-984dec-1"
          ],
          "languageIds": [
            "fr"
          ],
          "phenomenonIds": [
            "phenomenon-proto05-copy-1784236861048-984dec-7",
            "phenomenon-proto05-copy-1784236861048-984dec-8"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "segment-proto05-copy-1784236861048-984dec-5",
          "startMs": 100000,
          "endMs": 118000,
          "text": "On change de langue. Allez, on change de langue. Nicoli, Andréa, Évelyne, Julien, qui veut commencer ?",
          "speakerIds": [
            "speaker-proto05-copy-1784236861048-984dec-1"
          ],
          "languageIds": [
            "fr"
          ],
          "phenomenonIds": [
            "phenomenon-proto05-copy-1784236861048-984dec-9",
            "phenomenon-proto05-copy-1784236861048-984dec-10"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "segment-proto05-copy-1784236861048-984dec-6",
          "startMs": 118000,
          "endMs": 136000,
          "text": "Io sono di Espaa, studio en la Universidad de Salamanca. Sto facendo la carrera de Estudios franceses...",
          "speakerIds": [
            "speaker-proto05-copy-1784236861048-984dec-3"
          ],
          "languageIds": [
            "fr",
            "es",
            "it"
          ],
          "phenomenonIds": [
            "phenomenon-proto05-copy-1784236861048-984dec-11",
            "phenomenon-proto05-copy-1784236861048-984dec-12",
            "phenomenon-proto05-copy-1784236861048-984dec-13"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "segment-proto05-copy-1784236861048-984dec-7",
          "startMs": 143000,
          "endMs": 172000,
          "text": "Entiendo la mayoría del francés... l’italiano un poco... portugués nunca lo he estudiado, pero alguna parola sí que la entiendo...",
          "speakerIds": [
            "speaker-proto05-copy-1784236861048-984dec-3"
          ],
          "languageIds": [
            "fr",
            "es",
            "it",
            "pt"
          ],
          "phenomenonIds": [
            "phenomenon-proto05-copy-1784236861048-984dec-14",
            "phenomenon-proto05-copy-1784236861048-984dec-15"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "segment-proto05-copy-1784236861048-984dec-8",
          "startMs": 176000,
          "endMs": 185000,
          "text": "Alors, ça va ? Tout compris ? Un mot difficile, une expression plus difficile ?",
          "speakerIds": [
            "speaker-proto05-copy-1784236861048-984dec-1"
          ],
          "languageIds": [
            "fr"
          ],
          "phenomenonIds": [
            "phenomenon-proto05-copy-1784236861048-984dec-16",
            "phenomenon-proto05-copy-1784236861048-984dec-17"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "segment-proto05-copy-1784236861048-984dec-9",
          "startMs": 186000,
          "endMs": 225000,
          "text": "La carrera... comment on dit ça en français, Marie ? La filière... Carrière, non ? Littéralement, oui... mais en français on dirait plutôt un cursus, un diplôme, une filière.",
          "speakerIds": [
            "speaker-proto05-copy-1784236861048-984dec-1",
            "speaker-proto05-copy-1784236861048-984dec-5"
          ],
          "languageIds": [
            "fr",
            "es"
          ],
          "phenomenonIds": [
            "phenomenon-proto05-copy-1784236861048-984dec-18",
            "phenomenon-proto05-copy-1784236861048-984dec-19",
            "phenomenon-proto05-copy-1784236861048-984dec-20"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "segment-proto05-copy-1784236861048-984dec-10",
          "startMs": 241000,
          "endMs": 273000,
          "text": "Bueno, hola a todos. Mi chiamo Yassin, soy de Espagna... Vivo in Francia, in Lyon... estudio la carrera de el CEO espagnol...",
          "speakerIds": [
            "speaker-proto05-copy-1784236861048-984dec-4"
          ],
          "languageIds": [
            "fr",
            "es",
            "it"
          ],
          "phenomenonIds": [
            "phenomenon-proto05-copy-1784236861048-984dec-21",
            "phenomenon-proto05-copy-1784236861048-984dec-22",
            "phenomenon-proto05-copy-1784236861048-984dec-23"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "segment-proto05-copy-1784236861048-984dec-11",
          "startMs": 273000,
          "endMs": 302000,
          "text": "Mucho gusto, Yassine. Alors, bien compris ? Une question, une précision ? Oui, je hablo espagnol, français, anglais, un peu de catalan...",
          "speakerIds": [
            "speaker-proto05-copy-1784236861048-984dec-1",
            "speaker-proto05-copy-1784236861048-984dec-4"
          ],
          "languageIds": [
